: close it, or add its next task.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]project_task_pull_in.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/project_task_pull_in.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-6t[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-6t/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project pull-in contract and PP vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: add docs/task-dependencies.md §12.10 (trigger, rule, gate, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writes, reporting, copy, undo, interplay) with PP vectors, and amend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]§12, §13.4, projects/plan/capture docs, and README.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project pull-in in bob capture closes[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: after bob-cli-6s.5 lands, add the pure pull-in planner, wire it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into plan_successors and the ! and =x close paths, extend JSON and human[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output, and test the PP vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project pull-in in the cycler and the Unblocked notice[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins: mirror the pull-in in task-status-cycler (new fragments, gate, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]receipt) and render pull-in rows plus the missing project labels in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav's Unblocked notice.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install, deploy, verify, and record[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, plugins[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: install bob and deploy both plugins here, reach the MacBook [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]only after bob-cli-6s.12 closes, verify on a vault copy, and record the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]result.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-6t","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-6t.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e8170028f75988d724249656bf7973fe","started_at":"2026-10-12T14:08:32.026817+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6t","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6t.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6t.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6t.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6t.4","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6t.land"]}
